# T18302 — Communication Test in Private VLAN - Send from Uplink port — tb470 IE520 stack — 2026-09-30 — PASS

Verdict: PASS. All seven streams sent from the uplink (promiscuous) port did exactly what the case
expects. Broadcast, non-reserved multicast and unknown unicast reached all three private ports
(100/100 each). Each well-known unicast reached only its own port (100/100 there, 0 on the other
two). Reserved multicast 01:80:c2:00:00:00 was not forwarded (0 on every port). A control port
outside the private VLAN received none of it. Run labelled: clean.

Note on the reserved-multicast line: the DUT also drops 01:80:c2:00:00:00 in a plain VLAN (baseline
b0c below), so that line is a property of the platform, not of the private VLAN.

Operator: bench-runner subagent (sentinel = parent session, /test-mode shape A), Terrence away.
Queue: IE520/CAMPAIGN-QUEUE-2026-09-29.md row 7. Case text: ck.db AWPTCM-T18302 (1 step: setup +
7 streams). T18303 uses the "same configuration" and ran on the same build right after this case
(18303.log). One setup and one teardown served both.

## Bench mapping (case VLAN 10 → 3980/3981; Ixia 111–114 → DUT ports and tb470 NICs)
VLAN 10 is the live sa1 transit to the AR4050S on tb470 and was not touched, so the private VLAN is
primary **3980** + isolated secondary **3981**. Each private port's partner switch port sits alone
in its group scratch VLAN, and the group's observer trunk hands it to a host NIC tagged with that
VLAN. The partner switches are an observation path only (group setup, README).
| case | role | DUT port | MAC (case's static ARP) | observed at |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| IXIA-111 | uplink = `switchport mode private-vlan promiscuous`, mapping 3980 add 3981 | port3.0.13 | 0000.0000.0110 | tb470 eth1 (direct, the sender here) |
| IXIA-112 | private = `switchport mode private-vlan host`, host-association 3980 add 3981 | port1.0.2 | 0000.0000.0120 | eth3, tag 3991 (x230 port1.0.3 → observer trunk 1.0.1) |
| IXIA-113 | private | port1.0.13 | 0000.0000.0130 | eth2, tag 3993 (SA port1.0.13 → observer trunk 1.0.2) |
| IXIA-114 | private | port4.0.9 | 0000.0000.0140 | eth2, tag 3994 (SA port1.0.9 → observer trunk 1.0.2) |
| control (not in the private VLAN) | access 3992 | port1.0.9 | — | eth3, tag 3992 (x230 port1.0.4) |

