## Configuration (case step 1, 16:45:0x–16:45:43; evidence/18302/pv-cfg.sh + pv-cfg.out, no `% ` line)
```
interface port3.0.13/1.0.2/1.0.13/4.0.9: no switchport access vlan   (out of 3979)
vlan database: no vlan 3979 / vlan 3980 name ck-pv-primary / vlan 3981 name ck-pv-isolated
               private-vlan 3980 primary / private-vlan 3981 isolated / private-vlan 3980 association add 3981
interface port3.0.13: switchport mode private-vlan promiscuous / switchport private-vlan mapping 3980 add 3981
interface port1.0.2, port1.0.13, port4.0.9: switchport mode private-vlan host / switchport private-vlan host-association 3980 add 3981
interface vlan3980: ip address 192.168.100.254/24
arp 192.168.100.1 0000.0000.0110 port3.0.13 / arp 192.168.100.2 0000.0000.0120 port1.0.2
arp 192.168.100.3 0000.0000.0130 port1.0.13 / arp 192.168.100.4 0000.0000.0140 port4.0.9
```
Read back:
```
show vlan private-vlan:  3980  3981  isolated  port3.0.13 port1.0.2 port1.0.13 port4.0.9
show vlan brief:         3980 ck-pv-primary port3.0.13(u) / 3981 ck-pv-isolated port1.0.2(u) port1.0.13(u) (+ port4.0.9, wrapped)
show arp:                192.168.100.1-4 -> 0000.0000.0110/0120/0130/0140 vlan3980 port3.0.13/1.0.2/1.0.13/4.0.9 static
show mac address-table | include 0000.0000.01:
                         3980 and 3981: port3.0.13 ...0110, port1.0.2 ...0120, port1.0.13 ...0130, port4.0.9 ...0140  forward static
```
So the case's static ARP entries also install static FDB entries on the right ports in both the
primary and the secondary VLAN. The "well-known unicast" destinations are known without any learning.

## Step 2 — send from uplink 111 (eth1, src 0000.0000.0110, untagged), 16:46:20–16:48:43
Sender vsend.py, 100 frames per stream; driver evidence/group-2026-09-30/vstep.sh; captures
`tcpdump -Q in -e` on eth2 and eth3 filtered on src 0000.0000.0110, one pcap per stream. vcount
lists them as "unmarked" because my stream labels contain `-`, which its marker pattern does not
match. The counts are unaffected (one pcap per stream, src-filtered). DUT output-packet deltas: background is about +11 to +36 per port.

| stream (case) | dst | eth3 3991 (112) | eth2 3993 (113) | eth2 3994 (114) | eth3 3992 (control) | DUT out 1.0.2 / 1.0.13 / 4.0.9 / 1.0.9 | expected | result |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| a Broadcast | ff:ff:ff:ff:ff:ff | 100 | 100 | 100 | 0 | +134 / +123 / +123 / +11 | all VLAN ports | **PASS** |
| b Reserved multicast | 01:80:c2:00:00:00 | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 | +34 / +22 / +22 / +12 (background) | not forwarded | **PASS** |
| c Non-reserved multicast | 01:80:c2:01:01:01 | 100 | 100 | 100 | 0 | +136 / +124 / +124 / +13 | all VLAN ports | **PASS** |
| d Well-known unicast 112 | 0000.0000.0120 | 100 | 0 | 0 | 0 | +133 / +22 / +22 / +11 | IXIA-112 | **PASS** |
| e Well-known unicast 113 | 0000.0000.0130 | 0 | 100 | 0 | 0 | +33 / +123 / +23 / +11 | IXIA-113 | **PASS** |
| f Well-known unicast 114 | 0000.0000.0140 | 0 | 0 | 100 | 0 | +32 / +21 / +120 / +11 | IXIA-114 | **PASS** |
| g Unknown unicast | 00:00:5e:00:53:ff | 100 | 100 | 100 | 0 | +134 / +122 / +122 / +12 | all VLAN ports | **PASS** |
Every delivered frame arrived untagged at the DUT egress (the host-side tag is the partner's
scratch VLAN, one per port). Raw: evidence/18302/18302-{a-bc,b-rmc,c-mc,d-u112,e-u113,f-u114,g-uu}.out + .pcap.

## Teardown (after T18303, 16:53–16:55; evidence/18302/pv-teardown.sh, pv-teardown-try1.out, pv-teardown-2.sh + .out)
Try 1 applied `no arp 192.168.100.1-4`, `interface vlan3980` / `no ip address` and port1.0.2 `no
switchport private-vlan host-association`. It then stopped on my form `no switchport mode
private-vlan` (`% Incomplete command.`, which needs host|promiscuous, checked with `?`, evidence/18302/q-no-mode.out). The
state at the stop was read back (evidence/18302/td-state.out). Try 2 resumed from that line: the three host ports
`no switchport mode private-vlan host` + access 3991/3993/3994 (1.0.13 and 4.0.9 also `no switchport
private-vlan host-association`); port3.0.13 `no switchport private-vlan mapping` / `no switchport mode
private-vlan promiscuous` / `no switchport access vlan`; `private-vlan 3980 association remove 3981`,
`no private-vlan 3981 isolated`, `no private-vlan 3980 primary`, `no vlan 3981`, `no vlan 3980`. No `% `
line in try 2. After it, `show vlan private-vlan`, `show arp` and the 0000.0000.01xx MAC entries were all
empty. Post-case `show running-config` (post-test-configs/2026-09-30b/18302-18303.u{5,3,0}.out) diffed
against the group-setup reference: **empty on u5, u3 and u0**. Nothing was written to startup-config.

